-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Following the guidance above, clone the techskills_workshop repo open the branch called: pilot/databricks_workshop
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC The techskills_workshop repo can be found here: 
-- MAGIC https://github.com/dfe-analytical-services/techskills_workshops
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC and you can find the url to copy the repo in 'Code' 
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC ![Cloning Repo](data:image/png;base64,)
-- MAGIC
